type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44502-44523"><rb>天窓</rb><rt>あたま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-44523-44526">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44526-44538"><rb>禿</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-44538-44547">げたは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44547-44571"><rb>何事</rb><rt>なにごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-44571-44577">だ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44577-44589"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-44589-44592">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44592-44616"><rb>顱巻</rb><rt>はちまき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-44616-44619">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44619-44631"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-44631-44637">れ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44637-44658"><rb>恍気</rb><rt>とぼけ</rt></ruby>るな。」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44673-44685"><rb>目</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-44685-44688">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44688-44709"><rb>逆立</rb><rt>さかだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-44709-44718">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44718-44733"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-44733-44739">じり</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-44739-44772">〻</g><seg source="#source-44772-44775">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44775-44796"><rb>詰寄</rb><rt>つめよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-44796-44804">る。</seg></p>
