seg source="#source-45570-45573">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45573-45588"><rb>上</rb><rt>うへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45588-45591">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45591-45618"><rb>逆上</rb><rt>のぼせあが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45618-45645">らつしやるなよ――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45645-45657"><rb>何</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45657-45666">うやら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45666-45690"><rb>取逆</rb><rt>とりのぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45690-45696">せて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45696-45708"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby>さつしやるが、はて、」</p>
