        <p><seg source="#source-46285-46288">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46288-46303"><rb>分</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46303-46321">つたか。いや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46321-46342"><rb>昨夜</rb><rt>さくや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46342-46345">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46345-46369"><rb>失礼</rb><rt>しつれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46369-46381">したよ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46381-46402"><rb>魔物</rb><rt>まもの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46402-46405">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46405-46432"><rb>隊長</rb><rt>たいちやう</rt></ruby>。」</p>
        <p>「はて、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46452-46476"><rb>迷惑</rb><rt>めいわく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46476-46482">な、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46482-46497"><rb>私</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46497-46500">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46500-46521"><rb>魔物</rb><rt>まもの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46521-46527">だと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46527-46542"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby>はつしやる。」</p>
