        <p><seg source="#source-46927-46930">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46930-46954"><rb>成程</rb><rt>なるほど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46954-46957">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46957-46972"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46972-46975">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46975-46996"><rb>仔細</rb><rt>しさい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46996-46999">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46999-47011"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47011-47032">らつしやらぬお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47032-47056"><rb>前様</rb><rt>めえさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47056-47062">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47062-47083"><rb>様子</rb><rt>やうす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47083-47086">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47086-47098"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47098-47107">ても、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47107-47131"><rb>此処等</rb><rt>こゝら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47131-47134">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47134-47149"><rb>人</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby>ではござらつしやらぬ。」</p>
