        <p><seg source="#source-47972-47975">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47975-47999"><rb>莞爾</rb><rt>につこり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47999-48008">して、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48008-48029"><rb>草鞋</rb><rt>わらぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48029-48032">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48032-48047"><rb>尖</rb><rt>さき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48047-48050">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48050-48074"><rb>向直</rb><rt>むきなほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48074-48083">つた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48083-48095"><rb>早</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48095-48098">や</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48098-48116"><rb>煙</rb><rt>けむり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48116-48119">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48119-48140"><rb>余波</rb><rt>なごり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48140-48143">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48143-48155"><rb>消</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48155-48164">えて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48164-48182"><rb>浮脂</rb><rt>きら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48182-48185">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48185-48206"><rb>紅蓮</rb><rt>ぐれん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48206-48209">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48209-48221"><rb>絵</rb><rt>ゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48221-48224">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48224-48236"><rb>描</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48236-48245">かぬ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48245-48260"><rb>水</rb><rt>みづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48260-48263">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48263-48284"><rb>其方</rb><rt>そなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48284-48287">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48287-48302"><r