        <p><seg source="#source-48720-48723">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48723-48735"><rb>漕</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48735-48744">ぐのは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48744-48759"><rb>鷺</rb><rt>さぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48759-48765">でも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48765-48783"><rb>鳶</rb><rt>とんび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48783-48789">でも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48789-48804"><rb>構</rb><rt>かま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48804-48813">はん。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48813-48825"><rb>漕</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48825-48840">がせるのは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48840-48864"><rb>人間</rb><rt>にんげん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48864-48870">ぢや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48870-48882"><rb>無</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby>いのだらう。」</p>
