"><rb>船</rb><rt>ふね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-49774-49780">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-49780-49795"><rb>私</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-49795-49798">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-49798-49822"><rb>慰楽</rb><rt>なぐさみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-49822-49825">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-49825-49840"><rb>造</rb><rt>つく</rt></ruby>るでがす。」</p>
