        <p><seg source="#source-96174-96177">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-96177-96192"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-96192-96210"><rb>二世</rb><rt>にせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-96210-96237">なぞがあるものか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-96237-96258"><rb>魂</rb><rt>たましひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-96258-96261">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-96261-96276"><rb>滅</rb><rt>ほろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-96276-96294">びないでも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-96294-96306"><rb>死</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-96306-96312">ねば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-96312-96333"><rb>夫婦</rb><rt>ふうふ</rt></ruby>はわかれわかれだ。』</p>
