        <p><seg source="#source-96481-96484">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-96484-96502"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-96502-96505">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-96505-96517"><rb>此</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-96517-96520">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-96520-96532"><rb>世</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-96532-96547">ばかりでは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-96547-96562"><rb>厭</rb><rt>いや</rt></ruby>です。』</p>
