        <p><seg source="#source-106057-106060">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106060-106078"><rb>昔</rb><rt>むかし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106078-106081">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106081-106096"><rb>恋</rb><rt>こひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106096-106108">でがす。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106108-106123"><rb>彼</rb><rt>あれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106123-106138">でもの、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106138-106162"><rb>前様</rb><rt>めえさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106162-106165">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106165-106198"><rb>新造盛</rb><rt>しんざうざか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106198-106204">りの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106204-106219"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106219-106222">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106222-106234"><rb>有</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106234-106243">つけ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106243-106267"><rb>人形</rb><rt>あねさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106267-106270">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106270-106282"><rb>欲</rb><rt>ほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106282-106291">しがる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106291-106312"><rb>時分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106312-106330">ぢや。なんぼ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106330-106354"><rb>山鳥</rb><rt>やまどり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106354-106381">のおろのかゞみで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106381-106405"><rb>頤髯</rb><rt>あごひげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106405-106408">さ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106408-106420"><rb>撫</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106420-106426">でた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106426-106444"><rb>処</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10644