774"><rb>面</rb><rt>めん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106774-106783">やら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106783-106819"><rb>御機嫌取</rb><rt>ごきげんとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106819-106822">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106822-106840"><rb>拵</rb><rt>こしら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106840-106846">へて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106846-106858"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106858-106879">つて行つては、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106879-106903"><rb>莞爾</rb><rt>につこり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106903-106912">させて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106912-106933"><rb>他愛</rb><rt>たあい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106933-106939">なく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106939-106957"><rb>見惚</rb><rt>みと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106957-106963">れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106963-106975"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106975-107020">たものでがす。はゝゝ、はじめの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107020-107035"><rb>内</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107035-107038">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107038-107059"><rb>納戸</rb><rt>なんど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107059-107062">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107062-107086"><rb>押入</rb><rt>おしいれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107086-107089">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107089-107104"><rb>飾</rb><rt>かざ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107104-107116">つての、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107116-107128"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107128-107134">るな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107134-107146"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107146-107158">るな、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107158-107170"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107170-107176">ふ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107176-107191"><rb>恐</rb><rt>おそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107191-107203">ろしい、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107203-107221"><rb>男</rb><rt>をとこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107221-107224">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107224-107236"><rb>食</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107236-107242">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107242-107257"><rb>骨</rb><rt>ほね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107257-107260">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107260-107275"><rb>秘</rb><rt>かく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107275-107284">す、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107284-107299"><rb>村</rb><rt>むら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107299-107311">のものが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107311-107326"><rb>嬲</rb><rt>なぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107326-107347">つたつけの……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107347-107365"><rb>真個</rb><rt>ほん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107365-107368">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107368-107392"><rb>孤屋</rb><rt>ひとつや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107392-107395">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107395-107410"><rb>鬼</rb><rt>おに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107410-107413">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107413-107425"><rb>成</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107425-107434">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107434-107464"><rb>狸婆</rb><rt>たぬきばゞあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107464-107470">が、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107470-107485"><rb>旧</rb><rt>もと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107485-107488">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107488-107515"><rb>色仕掛</rb><rt>いろじか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107515-107521">けで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107521-107536"><rb>私</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107536-107539">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107539-107557"><rb>強請</rb><rt>ゆす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107557-107566">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107566-107581"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107581-107587">では</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107587-107605"><rb>銭</rb><rt>おあし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107605-107629">にするでがすが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107629-107650"><rb>旦那</rb><rt>だんな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107650-107653">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107653-107668"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107668-107671">か</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107671-107683"><rb>買</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107683-107701">はしつたか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107701-107722"><rb>沢山</rb><rt>たんと</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107722-107740"><rb>直切</rb><rt>ねぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107740-107758">らつしやれば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107758-107770"><rb>可</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby>かつけな。」</p>
