        <p><seg source="#source-109994-109997">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-109997-110018"><rb>猪</rb><rt>ゐのしゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110018-110021">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110021-110036"><rb>牙</rb><rt>きば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110036-110039">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110039-110054"><rb>拵</rb><rt>こさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110054-110078">へました、ほんに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110078-110090"><rb>佳</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110090-110093">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110093-110108"><rb>采</rb><rt>さい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110108-110129">でござります、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110129-110150"><rb>御覧</rb><rt>ごらう</rt></ruby>じまし。』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110168-110198"><rb>莞爾々々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-110183-110189">にこ</seg><choice source="#source-110189-110195"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110198-110213">しながら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110213-110234"><rb>掌</rb><rt>てのひら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110234-110237">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110237-110249"><rb>反</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110249-110258">らして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110258-110270"><rb>載</rb><rt>の</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110270-110276">せた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110276-110294"><rb>処</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110294-110300">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110300-110321"><rb>二人</rb><rt>ふたり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110321-110324">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110324-110345"><rb>一個</rb><rt>ひとつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110345-110351">づゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110351-110363"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110363-110374">つた。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110377-110392"><rb>采</rb><rt>さい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110392-110395">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110395-110410"><rb>珠</rb><rt>たま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110410-110422">のやうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110422-110434"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110434-110443">えた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110443-110464"><rb>綺麗</rb><rt>きれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110464-110467">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110467-110482"><rb>磨</rb><rt>みが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110482-110494">いたのが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110494-110518"><rb>透通</rb><rt>すきとほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110518-110533">るばかりに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110533-110551"><rb>出来</rb><rt>でき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110551-110557">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110557-110581"><rb>点々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-110566-110572">ぽち</seg><choice source="#source-110572-110578"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110581-110593"><rb>打</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110593-110599">つた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110599-110611"><rb>目</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110611-110614">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110614-110629"><rb>黒</rb><rt>くろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110629-110641">いのが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110641-110656"><rb>雪</rb><rt>ゆき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110656-110659">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110659-110674"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110674-110677">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110677-11