を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112892-112907"><rb>並</rb><rt>なら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112907-112916">べたお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112916-112931"><rb>浦</rb><rt>うら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112931-112934">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112934-112952"><rb>姿</rb><rt>すがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112952-112967">が、づゝと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112967-112982"><rb>離</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112982-112988">れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112988-113003"><rb>遥</rb><rt>はる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113003-113009">かな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113009-113024"><rb>向</rb><rt>むか</rt></ruby>ふへ……」</p>
