        <p><seg source="#source-123935-123938">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123938-123956"><rb>頻</rb><rt>しきり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123956-123959">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123959-123983"><rb>面目</rb><rt>めんもく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-123983-123992">ながる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-123992-124007"><rb>癖</rb><rt>くせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124007-124019">に、あは</seg><choice source="#source-124019-124025"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124025-124046"><rb>得意</rb><rt>とくい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124046-124055">らしい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124055-124079"><rb>高笑</rb><rt>たかわら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124079-124085">ひを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124085-124097"><rb>行</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124097-124106">つた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124106-124127"><rb>家内</rb><rt>かない</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124127-124130">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124130-124148"><rb>無事</rb><rt>ぶじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124148-124151">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124151-124178"><rb>祝福</rb><rt>しゆくふく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124178-124184">する</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124184-124202"><rb>心</rb><rt>こゝろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124202-124211">では、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124211-124232"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124232-124235">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124235-124247"><rb>魅</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124247-124268">せられたのを、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124268-124283"><rb>却</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124283-124289">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12