        <p><seg source="#source-124378-124381">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124381-124396"><rb>豪</rb><rt>えら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124396-124402">い、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124402-124429"><rb>東京</rb><rt>とうきやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124429-124432">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124432-124450"><rb>客</rb><rt>きやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124450-124453">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124453-124468"><rb>魅</rb><rt>だま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124468-124477">すのは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124477-124498"><rb>豪儀</rb><rt>がうぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124498-124519">だ。ひよい、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124519-124531"><rb>抱</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124531-124537">いて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124537-124570"><rb>温泉宿</rb><rt>をんせんやど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124570-124573">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124573-124600"><rb>屋根越</rb><rt>やねごし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124600-124603">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124603-124618"><rb>山</rb><rt>やま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124618-124621">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124621-124636"><rb>一</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124636-124651">つ、まるで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124651-124675"><rb>方角</rb><rt>はうがく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124675-124678">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124678-124693"><rb>違</rb><rt>ちが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124693-124699">つた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124699-124717"><rb>処</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124717-124723">へ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124723-124741"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124741-124744