        <p><seg source="#source-124974-124977">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-124977-124989"><rb>酔</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-124989-125013">つぱらひのやうな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125013-125028"><rb>言</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125028-125031">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125031-125043"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125043-125061">つて、ひよろ</seg><choice source="#source-125061-125067"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125067-125079"><rb>為</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125079-125091">ながら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125091-125103"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125103-125106">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125106-125124"><rb>男</rb><rt>をとこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125124-125127">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125127-125145"><rb>導</rb><rt>みちび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125145-125154">かれて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125154-125178"><rb>引返</rb><rt>ひきかへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125178-125186">す。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-125186-125189">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125189-125207"><rb>狐</rb><rt>きつね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125207-125210">や</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125210-125228"><rb>狸</rb><rt>たぬき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125228-125261">ではござりましねえ、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125261-125285"><rb>天守</rb><rt>てんしゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125285-125297">にござる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125297-125327"><rb>天狗様</rb><rt>てんぐさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125327-125339">だのエ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125339-125366"><rb>時々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-125348-125354">とき</seg><choice source="#source-125354-125363"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125366-125390"><rb>悪戯</rb><rt>いたづら</rt></ruby>をさつしやります。』</p>
        <p><seg source="#source-125422-125425">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125425-125440"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125440-125461"><rb>天狗</rb><rt>てんぐ</rt></ruby>。』</p>
