        <p>『えゝ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125573-125591"><rb>大</rb><rt>おほき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125591-125594">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125594-125609"><rb>声</rb><rt>こゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125609-125639">をさつしやりますな、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125639-125651"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby>こえるがのエ』と、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125678-125693"><rb>蒼</rb><rt>あを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125693-125696">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125696-125711"><rb>顔</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125711-125720">して、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125720-125732"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125732-125735">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125735-125753"><rb>男</rb><rt>をとこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125753-125759">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125759-125783"><rb>足許</rb><rt>あしもと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125783-125786">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125786-125798"><rb>樹</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125798-125801">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125801-125819"><rb>梢</rb><rt>こずゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125819-125825">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125825-125837"><rb>透</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125837-125843">いて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125843-125855"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125855-125864">える、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125864-125885"><rb>燈</rb><rt>ともしび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125885-125888">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125888-125903"><rb>影</rb><rt>かげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125903-125906">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125906-125924"><rb>指</rb><rt>ゆび