        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151072-151087"><rb>同</rb><rt>おな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151087-151099">じやうな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151099-151114"><rb>切</rb><rt>せつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151114-151120">ない</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151120-151135"><rb>夢</rb><rt>ゆめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151135-151141">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151141-151165"><rb>幾度</rb><rt>いくたび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151165-151174">となく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151174-151189"><rb>続</rb><rt>つゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151189-151195">けて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151195-151207"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151207-151213">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151213-151252"><rb>半死半生</rb><rt>はんしはんせい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151252-151255">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151255-151270"><rb>躰</rb><rt>てい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151270-151273">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151273-151285"><rb>漸</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151285-151291">つと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151291-151306"><rb>我</rb><rt>われ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151306-151309">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151309-151324"><rb>返</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151324-151330">つた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151330-151345"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151345-151348">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151348-151372"><rb>亭主</rb><rt>ていしゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151372-151380">が、</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-151380-151383">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151383-151413"><rb>御国許</rb><rt>おくにもと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151413-151416">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151416-151440"><rb>電報</rb><rt>でんぱう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151440-151446">をお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151446-151458"><rb>掛</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151458-151461">け</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151461-151479"><rb>被成</rb><rt>なさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151479-151494">りましては</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151494-151515"><rb>如何</rb><rt>いかゞ</rt></ruby>でござりませう。』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151545-151572"><rb>枕許</rb><rt>まくらもと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151572-151575">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151575-151590"><rb>坐</rb><rt>すは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151590-151596">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151596-151608"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151608-151622">ました。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-151622-151625">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151625-151643"><rb>馬鹿</rb><rt>ばか</rt></ruby>な。』</p>
        <p><seg source="#source-151654-151657">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151657-151681"><rb>一言</rb><rt>いちごん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-151681-151693">のもとに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-151693-151711"><rb>卻</rb><rt>しりぞ</rt></ruby>けたんです。」</p>
