        <p>「それ<choice source="#source-169339-169345"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-169345-169348">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169348-169360"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169360-169363">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169363-169387"><rb>坊様</rb><rt>ばうさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169387-169396">なら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169396-169411"><rb>宵</rb><rt>よひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169411-169414">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169414-169429"><rb>口</rb><rt>くち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169429-169432">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169432-169447"><rb>私</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169447-169450">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169450-169465"><rb>頼</rb><rt>たの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169465-169471">んで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169471-169498"><rb>四手場</rb><rt>よつでば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169498-169501">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169501-169513"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169513-169516">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169516-169531"><rb>貰</rb><rt>もら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169531-169564">ふたのぢや……、はあ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169564-169582"><rb>其処</rb><rt>そこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169582-169588">へお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169588-169612"><rb>前様</rb><rt>めえさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169612-169615">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169615-169636"><rb>行逢</rb><rt>ゆきあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169636-169675">はしつたの。はて、どうも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-169675-169705"><rb>妙智力</rb><rt>めうちりき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-169705-169708">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#s