        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-201088-201097">さあ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201097-201112"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201112-201124">ものかゞ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201124-201136"><rb>寄</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201136-201142">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201142-201157"><rb>集</rb><rt>たか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201157-201166">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201166-201181"><rb>誰</rb><rt>たれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201181-201187">かを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201187-201214"><rb>白裸</rb><rt>まるはだか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201214-201229">にした、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201229-201244"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201244-201255">へば、</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-201255-201258">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201258-201273"><rb>犬</rb><rt>いぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201273-201279">よ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201279-201294"><rb>犬</rb><rt>いぬ</rt></ruby>よ。』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201306-201318"><rb>呼</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201318-201341">んだのがある。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-201341-201404">びやう、びやう、うおゝ、うおゝ、うゝ、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201404-201419"><rb>遥</rb><rt>はる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201419-201425">かに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201425-201440"><rb>犬</rb><rt>いぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201440-201443">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201443-201467"><rb>長吠</rb><rt>ながぼえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201467-201476">して、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201476-201497"><rb>可忌</rb><rt>いまは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201497-201503">しく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201503-201524"><rb>夜陰</rb><rt>やいん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201524-201527">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201527-201545"><rb>貫</rb><rt>つらぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201545-201557">いたが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201557-201575"><rb>瞬</rb><rt>またゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201575-201578">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201578-201590"><rb>間</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201590-201596">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201596-201611"><rb>里</rb><rt>さと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201611-201614">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201614-201629"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201629-201638">から、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201638-201653"><rb>風</rb><rt>かぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201653-201665">のやうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201665-201680"><rb>颯</rb><rt>さつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201680-201683">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201683-201695"><rb>来</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201695-201701">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201701-201722"><rb>背後