        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241711-241735"><rb>狂気</rb><rt>きやうき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241735-241744">した、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241744-241759"><rb>変</rb><rt>へん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241759-241768">だ、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241768-241780"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241780-241789">ふのは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241789-241810"><rb>言葉</rb><rt>ことば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241810-241813">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241813-241843"><rb>切目毎</rb><rt>きれめごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241843-241846">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241846-241861"><rb>耳</rb><rt>みゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241861-241864">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241864-241879"><rb>入</rb><rt>はい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241879-241906">つた。が、これほど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241906-241924"><rb>確</rb><rt>たしか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241924-241927">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241927-241942"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241942-241948">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241948-241969"><rb>渠等</rb><rt>かれら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241969-241972">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241972-241987"><rb>雲</rb><rt>くも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241987-241990">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241990-242005"><rb>掴</rb><rt>つか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-242005-242017">むやうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-242017-242029"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-242029-242050">くのであらう。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-242050-242065"><rb>我</rb><rt>われ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24206