        <p>「……しかし、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258189-258201"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258201-258204">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258204-258219"><rb>後</rb><rt>のち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258219-258225">とも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258225-258246"><rb>三度</rb><rt>さんど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258246-258249">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258249-258273"><rb>食事</rb><rt>しよくじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258273-258276">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258276-258288"><rb>火</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258288-258297">なり、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258297-258312"><rb>水</rb><rt>みづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258312-258321">なり、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258321-258339"><rb>祠</rb><rt>ほこら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258339-258342">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258342-258354"><rb>来</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258354-258357">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258357-258372"><rb>用</rb><rt>よう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258372-258375">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258375-258387"><rb>達</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258387-258408">してくれたのは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258408-258420"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258420-258423">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258423-258441"><rb>男</rb><rt>をとこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258441-258447">で。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258447-258462"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258462-258477">とすると、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258477-258516"><rb>二時三時</rb><rt>ふたときみとき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258516-258519">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" sou