        <p>『どうだ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-259901-259922"><rb>大分</rb><rt>だいぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-259922-259931">ものに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-259931-259943"><rb>成</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby>つたらう、』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-259964-259982"><rb>聊</rb><rt>いさゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-259982-259985">か</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-259985-260006"><rb>得意</rb><rt>とくい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260006-260012">で。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260012-260030"><rb>丁</rb><rt>ちやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260030-260033">ど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260033-260051"><rb>居合</rb><rt>ゐあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260051-260060">はせた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260060-260084"><rb>権七</rb><rt>ごんしち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260084-260087">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260087-260102"><rb>顔</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260102-260105">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260105-260117"><rb>目</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260117-260120">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260120-260132"><rb>挙</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260132-260138">げて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260138-260150"><rb>恁</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260150-260153">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260153-260165"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260165-260177">ると……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260177-260189"><rb>日</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260189-260192">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260192-260204"><rb>焼</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260204-260210">けた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260210-260225"><rb>色</rb><rt>いろ</rt></