        <p>「それは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278026-278044"><rb>狐</rb><rt>きつね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-278044-278047">か</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278047-278062"><rb>犬</rb><rt>いぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-278062-278074">らしい、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278074-278089"><rb>其</rb><rt>それ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-278089-278095">とも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278095-278110"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-278110-278113">か</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278113-278128"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-278128-278131">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278131-278143"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-278143-278149">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278149-278164"><rb>上</rb><rt>うへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-278164-278173">をふわ</seg><choice source="#source-278173-278179"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-278179-278182">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278182-278194"><rb>飛</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-278194-278209">んだのかも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278209-278224"><rb>分</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby>りません。」</p>
        <p><seg source="#source-278244-278247">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278247-278268"><rb>雪枝</rb><rt>ゆきえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-278268-278271">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278271-278292"><rb>老爺</rb><rt>ぢゞい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-278292-278295">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-278295-278307"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-278307-278335">ふのであつた……</seg></p>
