        <p>『はつ、』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-333800-333824"><rb>歎息</rb><rt>たんそく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-333824-333835">した。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-333838-333856"><rb>老爺</rb><rt>ぢい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-333856-333874">は、もつぺの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-333874-333889"><rb>膝</rb><rt>ひざ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-333889-333892">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-333892-333925"><rb>小刀屑</rb><rt>こがたなくづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-333925-333928">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-333928-333943"><rb>払</rb><rt>はた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-333943-333958">きながら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-333958-333973"><rb>眉</rb><rt>まゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-333973-333982">をふさ</seg><choice source="#source-333982-333988"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-333988-333991">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-333991-334006"><rb>揺</rb><rt>ゆす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-334006-334012">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-334012-334027"><rb>笑</rb><rt>わら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-334027-334035">ひ、</seg></p>
