を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-344056-344068"><rb>遣</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-344068-344074">り、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-344074-344098"><rb>格合</rb><rt>かくかう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-344098-344101">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-344101-344116"><rb>折</rb><rt>をり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-344116-344125">から、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-344125-344140"><rb>少</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-344140-344152">いものを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-344152-344167"><rb>煽</rb><rt>あふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-344167-344170">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-344170-344182"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-344182-344191">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-344191-344212"><rb>身代</rb><rt>みがは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-344212-344218">りに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-344218-344236"><rb>働</rb><rt>はたら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-344236-344248">かせやう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-344248-344260"><rb>気</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-344260-344266">かも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-344266-344281"><rb>計</rb><rt>はか</rt></ruby>られぬ。』</p>
