">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351006-351021"><rb>以</rb><rt>もつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351021-351024">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351024-351039"><rb>妻</rb><rt>つま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351039-351042">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351042-351060"><rb>償</rb><rt>あがな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351060-351069">へ！　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351069-351090"><rb>魔神</rb><rt>まじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351090-351093">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351093-351111"><rb>慰</rb><rt>なぐさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351111-351114">め</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351114-351129"><rb>楽</rb><rt>たの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351129-351150">しますものゝ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351150-351171"><rb>美女</rb><rt>びじよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351171-351174">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351174-351186"><rb>代</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351186-351192">へて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351192-351207"><rb>然</rb><rt>しか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351207-351222">るべきなら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351222-351249"><rb>立処</rb><rt>たちどころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351249-351252">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351252-351267"><rb>返</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351267-351270">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351270-351282"><rb>得</rb><rt>え</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351282-351302">さする。――</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351305-351317"><rb>可</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351317-351329">いかな、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351329-351341"><rb>此</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351341-351344">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351344-351362"><rb>心</rb><rt>こゝろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351362-351365">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351365-351377"><rb>早</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351377-351380">や</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351380-351398"><rb>御身</rb><rt>おみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351398-351401">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351401-351422"><rb>内儀</rb><rt>ないぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351422-351428">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351428-351443"><rb>私</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351443-351446">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351446-351461"><rb>頼</rb><rt>たの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351461-351473">まれて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351473-351491"><rb>御身</rb><rt>おみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351491-351494">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351494-351509"><rb>伝</rb><rt>つた</rt></ruby>へた。』</p>
