9884">ねもせう。……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-359884-359896"><rb>然</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-359896-359902">れば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-359902-359920"><rb>御身</rb><rt>おみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-359920-359926">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-359926-359941"><rb>少</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-359941-359953">いものゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-359953-359977"><rb>尻圧</rb><rt>しりおし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-359977-359983">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-359983-359998"><rb>石</rb><rt>いし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-359998-360001">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360001-360013"><rb>成</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360013-360025">るまでも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360025-360043"><rb>働</rb><rt>はたら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360043-360052">け、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360052-360067"><rb>励</rb><rt>はげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360067-360091">ますのぢや。で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360091-360109"><rb>唆</rb><rt>そゝの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360109-360121">かすとは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360121-360136"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360136-360148">ふまい。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360148-360175"><rb>徒労力</rb><rt>むだぼね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360175-360193">をさせるとは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360193-360205"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360205-360223">るまい。が、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360223-360238"><rb>私</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360238-360244">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360244-360262"><rb>無駄</rb><rt>むだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360262-360268">ぢや</seg><ruby type="furigan