        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360402-360420"><rb>其処</rb><rt>そこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360420-360426">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360426-360447"><rb>老爺</rb><rt>おやぢ</rt></ruby>、』</p>
